  "bio": "Discover the time-honored artistry of traditional tattoos at Electric Eye Studio, where master ink wizard Caleb Barnard brings your visions to life. Nestled in the heart of Dallas, this haven of creativity combines Southwestern charm with classic designs to create truly one-of-a-kind body art. Step into a world where bold lines and vibrant colors merge, and leave with a piece of timeless beauty etched into your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Dallas, Texas, United States"
